# Scenario 'mail_send': send the mail that 'mail_compose' saved (outbox) with おくる/うけとる over the fake Internet:
# dial, PPP, DNS, SMTP (HELO/MAIL FROM/RCPT TO/DATA/QUIT, all answered 250/354), POP3 (empty mailbox), disconnect,
# communication-result screen. Starts from the state left by 'mail_compose'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot top_menu
tap A                        # top menu: メール
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu
tap A                        # おくる/うけとる
waitstable 60 max 300
shot send_receive_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot send_receive_2
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot password_saved
tap A                        # "0でつうしんをはじめる"
waitstable 60 max 300
shot connecting
waitstable 60 max 900
shot smtp_sending
wait 700
shot no_mail_received
waitstable 60 max 900
shot comm_finished
tap A                        # dismiss
waitstable 60 max 600
shot result_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot result_2
tap A                        # back to the mail menu
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu_again
